# Keep the icon's working-tree bytes identical on every platform.
#
# `tests/unit/manifest.spec.ts` pins `docs/market/index.json`'s inlined icon and
# `docs/favicon.svg` to the bytes of `icon.svg`. The index is generated from the
# published package, which was packed on a checkout with LF endings, so a
# Windows clone with `core.autocrlf=true` produced CRLF here and the comparison
# failed for a reason that has nothing to do with the artwork. Pinning the
# endings removes the platform from the equation instead of loosening the
# assertion to a normalized comparison, which would stop catching real drift.
*.svg text eol=lf
